{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275, outperforming the pca_n2000-based multiprofile baseline (0.5907 accuracy). The results suggest the RNA encoder choice may influence performance in multiprofile settings, but the absence of comparisons to other encoders and the lack of multimodal interaction analysis leave the broader impact of encoder design uncertain."
}

